<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko" class="lang-ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow">
  <title>안전한 접속 확인 | 캐치</title>

  <script type="text/javascript" nonce="XOJ0BVE+zr3qdJZKBBAaLFbFzesxhK/xP1QmLnOdycs=">error code: 521</script><script>
    (function () {
      var browserLanguages = [];

      if (navigator.languages && navigator.languages.length > 0) {
        browserLanguages = navigator.languages;
      } else if (navigator.language) {
        browserLanguages = [navigator.language];
      } else if (navigator.userLanguage) {
        browserLanguages = [navigator.userLanguage];
      }

      var isKoreanBrowser = browserLanguages.some(function (language) {
        return String(language || "").toLowerCase().indexOf("ko") === 0;
      });

      var pageLanguage = isKoreanBrowser ? "ko" : "en";

      document.documentElement.lang = pageLanguage;
      document.documentElement.className = document.documentElement.className
        .replace(/\blang-ko\b/g, "")
        .replace(/\blang-en\b/g, "")
        .trim();

      document.documentElement.className = (
        document.documentElement.className + " lang-" + pageLanguage
      ).trim();

      document.title = isKoreanBrowser
        ? "안전한 접속 확인 | 캐치"
        : "Security Check | CATCH";
    })();
  </script>

  <style>
    :root {
      --catch-black: #111111;
      --catch-text: #222222;
      --catch-muted: #777777;
      --catch-border: #eeeeee;
      --catch-bg: #f7f8fa;
      --catch-card: #ffffff;
      --catch-accent: #00c471;
      --catch-accent-dark: #00a85f;
      --catch-soft: #e9fff4;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html, body {
      min-height: 100%;
    }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Pretendard",
                   "Noto Sans KR", "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 18% 12%, rgba(0, 196, 113, 0.12), transparent 28%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 84% 18%, rgba(0, 196, 113, 0.08), transparent 24%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, var(--catch-bg) 100%);
      color: var(--catch-text);
      line-height: 1.55;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      word-break: keep-all;
    }

    html.lang-en body {
      word-break: normal;
    }

    .page {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .topbar {
      height: 68px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--catch-border);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    }

    .topbar-inner {
      width: min(100%, 1080px);
      padding: 0 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .brand {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--catch-black);
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      font-size: 25px;
    }

    .brand-dot {
      width: 11px;
      height: 11px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--catch-accent);
      display: inline-block;
      transform: translateY(1px);
    }

    .top-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: center;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .top-links a {
      color: #555555;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .top-links a:hover {
      color: var(--catch-black);
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 4px;
    }

    .main {
      flex: 1;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      padding: 48px 20px;
    }

    .card {
      width: min(100%, 560px);
      background: var(--catch-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--catch-border);
      border-radius: 28px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      padding: 42px 38px 34px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      min-height: 34px;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--catch-soft);
      color: var(--catch-accent-dark);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .badge::before {
      content: "";
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--catch-accent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(0, 196, 113, 0.12);
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 28px;
      line-height: 1.28;
      letter-spacing: -0.055em;
      color: var(--catch-black);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    html.lang-en h1 {
      letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    }

    .desc {
      color: #555555;
      font-size: 16px;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    html.lang-en .desc {
      letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    }

    .challenge-box {
      margin: 26px auto 22px;
      min-height: 86px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .challenge-box > * {
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    .notice {
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 15px 16px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: #fafafa;
      border: 1px solid var(--catch-border);
      color: #666666;
      font-size: 14px;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .notice strong {
      color: var(--catch-black);
    }

    .actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 22px;
    }

    .btn {
      min-width: 132px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 44px;
      padding: 0 18px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--catch-border);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: transform 120ms ease, box-shadow 120ms ease, background 120ms ease;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--catch-black);
      color: #ffffff;
      border-color: var(--catch-black);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: #ffffff;
      color: var(--catch-black);
    }

    .meta {
      margin-top: 22px;
      color: #9a9a9a;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    .footer {
      padding: 22px 20px 30px;
      color: #999999;
      font-size: 12px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .footer a {
      color: #777777;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .footer a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 4px;
    }

    .i18n-en {
      display: none;
    }

    html.lang-en .i18n-ko {
      display: none;
    }

    html.lang-en .i18n-en {
      display: inline;
    }

    html.lang-en .i18n-en.block {
      display: block;
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .topbar {
        height: 62px;
      }

      .topbar-inner {
        padding: 0 18px;
      }

      .brand {
        font-size: 23px;
      }

      .top-links {
        gap: 12px;
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .top-links .hide-mobile {
        display: none;
      }

      .main {
        padding: 34px 16px;
      }

      .card {
        border-radius: 22px;
        padding: 34px 22px 28px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 24px;
      }

      .desc {
        font-size: 15px;
      }

      .actions {
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .btn {
        width: 100%;
      }
    }
  </style>
<meta http-equiv="refresh" content="360"></head>
<body>
  <div class="page">
    <header class="topbar" aria-label="CATCH header">
      <div class="topbar-inner">
        <a class="brand" href="https://www.catch.co.kr/" aria-label="CATCH home">
          CATCH <span class="brand-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </a>
        <nav class="top-links" aria-label="Support links">
          <a href="https://www.catch.co.kr/Customer/CustomerMain">
            <span class="i18n-ko">고객센터</span>
            <span class="i18n-en">Support</span>
          </a>
          <a class="hide-mobile" href="https://www.catch.co.kr/Customer/CustomerUseGuide">
            <span class="i18n-ko">자주 묻는 질문</span>
            <span class="i18n-en">FAQ</span>
          </a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="main">
      <section class="card" aria-labelledby="challenge-title">
        <div class="badge">
          <span class="i18n-ko">안전한 접속 확인</span>
          <span class="i18n-en">Security Check</span>
        </div>

        <h1 id="challenge-title">
          <span class="i18n-ko">캐치 서비스를 안전하게 이용하실 수 있도록 접속 환경을 확인하고 있습니다.</span>
          <span class="i18n-en">We are checking your connection to keep CATCH safe and reliable.</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="desc">
          <span class="i18n-ko">확인이 완료되면 요청하신 페이지로 자동 이동합니다.<br>잠시만 기다려 주세요.</span>
          <span class="i18n-en">Once verification is complete, you will be redirected automatically.<br>Please wait a moment.</span>
        </p>

        <div class="challenge-box" aria-label="Cloudflare security check">
