        </div>

        <div class="notice">
          <span class="i18n-ko">
            <strong>화면이 반복해서 표시되나요?</strong><br>
            브라우저 새로고침 후 다시 시도해 주세요. 문제가 계속되면 고객센터로 문의해 주시기 바랍니다.
          </span>
          <span class="i18n-en block">
            <strong>Seeing this page repeatedly?</strong><br>
            Refresh your browser and try again. If the issue continues, please contact our support center.
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://www.catch.co.kr/Customer/CustomerAdvice">
            <span class="i18n-ko">1:1 문의하기</span>
            <span class="i18n-en">Contact Support</span>
          </a>
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://www.catch.co.kr/Customer/CustomerMain">
            <span class="i18n-ko">고객센터</span>
            <span class="i18n-en">Support Center</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <p class="meta">
          <span class="i18n-ko">요청 ID</span>
          <span class="i18n-en">Request ID</span>
          : a4a6d628cf846110
        </p>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="footer">
      <a href="https://www.catch.co.kr/">
        <span class="i18n-ko">캐치 홈</span>
        <span class="i18n-en">CATCH Home</span>
      </a>
      <span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>
      <a href="https://www.catch.co.kr/Customer/CustomerMain">
        <span class="i18n-ko">고객센터</span>
        <span class="i18n-en">Support</span>
      </a>
      <br>
      Copyright © CATCH. All rights reserved.
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>